Arguments are:
query (required): Gmail query string, e.g. "from:alice@example.com newer_than:90d"
max_results: int, default 200, max 500
group_by_sender: true/false (default true)
group_by_day: true/false (default false)
top_senders_limit: int (default 10)
account_id: optional; canonical value is exactly "google_user_primary" — do not abbreviate or alter this value
